@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@candidateToken = REPLACE_WITH_CANDIDATE_JWT
@notificationId = REPLACE_WITH_NOTIFICATION_UUID

### Feed: own notifications, 1-based page, size 1–100
GET {{baseUrl}}/recruitment/me/notifications?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### Unread only; unreadCount always counts all unread items for the caller
GET {{baseUrl}}/recruitment/me/notifications?unreadOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### Idempotent read; 204 or 404 for missing/another user's notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/recruitment/me/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}

### Idempotent read-all; affects only current JWT owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/recruitment/me/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
